flowchart TD
    Entity[existing JCIEntity target] -->|CHANGED_BY| ChangeEvent
    ChangeEvent -. pending means TRIGGERS = 0 .-> Pending[no completed event yet]
    ChangeEvent -. plans one attempt .-> Run[SyncRun with unique runId]
    Run -. uses .-> Definition[SYNC]
    Run -. validates .-> Decision{outcome}
    Decision --> Success[SUCCESS]
    Decision --> Conflict[CONFLICT]
    Decision --> Failed[FAILED]
    Success --> Apply[commit atomically]
    Conflict --> Rollback[roll back completely]
    Failed --> Rollback
    Apply --> Event[SyncEvent]
    Rollback --> Event
    ChangeEvent -->|TRIGGERS| Event[SyncEvent after completion]
    Event -->|EXECUTES| Definition
    Event -->|AFFECTS| Affected[resolved JCIEntity required for SUCCESS or CONFLICT]
    Failed -. may have no AFFECTS only before target resolution .-> Event
    Apply -. CREATED only .-> NewEntity[new JCIEntity revision 1 and no PiH]
    NewEntity -->|CHANGED_BY| ChangeEvent
